  "_notes": [
    "Canon Tier 1 Adventure gear has NO off-hand items for any class. Off-hands",
    "first appear at Raid rung (Boss 2 healer Tome, Boss 5 Shield and Instrument).",
    "That is canon as written, not an omission in this file.",
    "The three healer weapons share one display name on purpose: canon itself",
    "names all three raid healer weapons identically ('Basic Healing Weapon'),",
    "so identical naming across the healer families is canon-consistent.",
    "Canon writes 'Adventures Charm of Power' without the apostrophe. Treated as",
    "a typo and normalised to 'Adventure's Charm of Power'; stats are untouched."
